  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Employment Creation for Vulnerable Lebanese Citizens and Syrian Displaced Population in Livestock Value Chain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s development objective is to create decent employment opportunities and improve incomes of vulnerable Lebanese farmers, particularly women, and displaced population through strengthened animal value chains, and creating job opportunities along the project-supported value chains.</narrative>
  </description>
